      "body": "It seems that something went wrong in commit d224c79 which is an automated commit made by running `make -f lib/setup.mk` when using martinthomson/i-d-template.\nI don't know what happened, but something in that script identified the WG as the Spatial Reuse Protocol (SRP) instead of DNSSD.\nSo we can either ask for a presentation at the Spatial Reuse Protocol WG or update the venue of this draft. I propose the latter... :-)  ",
